  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass 2 kg moving with velocity of $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{in}}=3 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+4 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}} \\mathrm{ms}^{-1}$ enters into a constant force field of 6 N directed along positive z -axis. If the body remains in the field for a period of $\\frac{5}{3}$ seconds, then velocity of the body when it emerges from force field is",
    "image": null
  },
